<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<div class="ballot-head"><div class="bar"></div><div class="hairlines"></div></div>
<p class="eyebrow">Accounts — <%= currentLocal.name %></p>
<h1>Committee &amp; observer accounts</h1>
<p class="sub">Accounts created here belong to <strong><%= currentLocal.name %></strong> and can see
only this local's roster, votes, and audit chain. Every candidate has the right to an observer.
Observer accounts are read-only: turnout, configuration, audit log, results — never ballots, never
credentials. Usernames are unique across the whole platform, so include your local number if a
name is taken.</p>
<h2>Create account</h2>
<form method="post" action="/admin/users" style="max-width:460px">
  <label>Display name</label><input type="text" name="display_name" required placeholder="Observer for Candidate Smith">
  <label>Username</label><input type="text" name="username" required>
  <label>Password (10+ characters)</label><input type="text" name="password" minlength="10" required>
  <label>Recovery email (optional — enables the forgot-password flow)</label>
  <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="off" placeholder="committee@example.org">
  <label>Role</label>
  <select name="role"><option value="observer">Observer (read-only)</option><option value="admin">Administrator</option></select>
  <button class="btn" type="submit">Create</button>
</form>
<h2>Existing accounts</h2>
<p class="sub">An account with a <strong>recovery email</strong> can reset a forgotten password
itself via the emailed link on the sign-in page<% if (!smtp) { %> (once SMTP is configured)<% } %>.
Accounts without one depend on platform support for a one-time reset link — add an email for every
administrator. Passwords are never emailed or displayed; a reset link only lets its holder choose
a new one.</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Name</th><th>Username</th><th>Role</th><th>Recovery email</th><th>Created</th></tr>
<% users.forEach(function (u) { %>
<tr>
  <td><%= u.display_name %></td>
  <td><%= u.username %></td>
  <td><%= u.role %></td>
  <td>
    <form method="post" action="/admin/users/<%= u.id %>/email" style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:0">
      <input type="email" name="email" value="<%= u.email || '' %>" placeholder="none — cannot use email reset" style="min-width:220px">
      <button class="btn small" type="submit">Save</button>
    </form>
  </td>
  <td><%= u.created_at %></td>
</tr>
<% }) %>
</table>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
